:"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"callout","callout":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"一句话：黑粉剪辑是一个跑在本机的专业视频剪辑软件。达芬奇的键位和页面模型、磁性主故事线、本地转写字幕、AI 助理直接改真实工程——不联网、不上传素材、免费。现在是初步构建预览版。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"一句话：黑粉剪辑是一个跑在本机的专业视频剪辑软件。达芬奇的键位和页面模型、磁性主故事线、本地转写字幕、AI 助理直接改真实工程——不联网、不上传素材、免费。现在是初步构建预览版。","href":null}],"icon":{"type":"emoji","emoji":"✂️"},"color":"orange_background"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81f6-9f47-cf1526cfb334","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81bf-9e38-d4ecc53d476a"},"created_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"heading_2","heading_2":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"▍为什么自己写一个剪辑软件","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"▍为什么自己写一个剪辑软件","href":null}],"is_toggleable":false,"color":"orange"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-819a-b28c-cd560ce1530b","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81bf-9e38-d4ecc53d476a"},"created_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"我每周要出好几条视频，剪辑这件事却始终卡在两头：专业软件强大但和 AI 工作流是两个世界，素材、字幕、口播稿在几个工具之间来回倒；而各种「AI 剪辑」工具又太黑箱——它替你剪完了，你想改一刀都难，更别提把工程交给下一道工序。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"我每周要出好几条视频，剪辑这件事却始终卡在两头：专业软件强大但和 AI 工作流是两个世界，素材、字幕、口播稿在几个工具之间来回倒；而各种「AI 剪辑」工具又太黑箱——它替你剪完了，你想改一刀都难，更别提把工程交给下一道工序。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-8137-baad-e665e7c58c78","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81bf-9e38-d4ecc53d476a"},"created_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"我要的其实很明确：一条真实的时间线，专业软件的操作习惯，AI 能进来干活但每一步都可撤销、可复核。市面上没有，就自己写了一个。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"我要的其实很明确：一条真实的时间线，专业软件的操作习惯，AI 能进来干活但每一步都可撤销、可复核。市面上没有，就自己写了一个。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-8121-b8d5-da2cb9cfa513","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81bf-9e38-d4ecc53d476a"},"created_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"image","image":{"caption":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"# 精编工作区：媒体池、时间线合成检视器、检查器三栏，下方是主时间线。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"# 精编工作区：媒体池、时间线合成检视器、检查器三栏，下方是主时间线。","href":null}],"type":"file","file":{"url":"/downloads/hyphencut-local-video-editor-3cc99968-1bdb-8121-b8d5-da2cb9c-8805a59e.png","expiry_time":"2026-08-30T15:53:39.956Z"}},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"