Shift-2 到 Shift-8 直接切换。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-8144-be15-f2fbb3182c35","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81bf-9e38-d4ecc53d476a"},"created_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"paragraph","paragraph":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"命令层现在有 207 条命令、9 个分类，其中 194 条是对着 DaVinci Resolve 官方手册逐页核对过键位的基线——不是「大概像」，是每条都标了手册页码。键位方案可以在达芬奇、Premiere Pro、Final Cut Pro 之间切换，切换后有守卫测试保证没有命令静默失去快捷键。找不到功能就按 ⌘⇧P 打开命令面板，搜索、回车执行。","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"命令层现在有 207 条命令、9 个分类，其中 194 条是对着 DaVinci Resolve 官方手册逐页核对过键位的基线——不是「大概像」，是每条都标了手册页码。键位方案可以在达芬奇、Premiere Pro、Final Cut Pro 之间切换，切换后有守卫测试保证没有命令静默失去快捷键。找不到功能就按 ⌘⇧P 打开命令面板，搜索、回车执行。","href":null}],"icon":null,"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81f2-9e06-da15259ff448","parent":{"type":"page_id","page_id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81bf-9e38-d4ecc53d476a"},"created_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","last_edited_time":"2026-08-30T05:03:00.000Z","created_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"last_edited_by":{"object":"user","id":"482aa66e-4aea-4811-9fbb-750cd1c10e34"},"has_children":false,"in_trash":false,"type":"bulleted_list_item","bulleted_list_item":{"rich_text":[{"type":"text","text":{"content":"磁性主故事线 + 连接片段：拖动主线，连接的字幕和贴片跟着走","link":null},"annotations":{"bold":false,"italic":false,"strikethrough":false,"underline":false,"code":false,"color":"default"},"plain_text":"磁性主故事线 + 连接片段：拖动主线，连接的字幕和贴片跟着走","href":null}],"color":"default"},"archived":false},{"object":"block","id":"3cc99968-1bdb-81c1-99db-ec5334592f76","parent":{"type":"